mal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;=20mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >概念：定期（如每天）全量保存一份维度表。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;=20mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >解释：每天把整个维度表复制到一个独立表</font><font face=3D"宋体" >/分区，不管数据变没变。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;=20mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >举例：用户维度表每日快照。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;=20mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >2024-01-01 快照表：dim_user_20240101</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;=20mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋